## Java 版
```java
import java.util.Arrays;

public class Main {
    public static void bubbleSort(int[] a) {
        int n = a.length;
        for (int i = 0; i < n - 1; i++) {
            boolean swapped = false;
            for (int j = 0; j < n - 1 - i; j++) {
                if (a[j] > a[j + 1]) {
                    int t = a[j];
                    a[j] = a[j + 1];
                    a[j + 1] = t;
                    swapped = true;
                }
            }
            if (!swapped) break;
        }
    }

    public static void main(String[] args) {
        int[] a = {5, 1, 4, 2, 8};
        bubbleSort(a);
        System.out.println(Arrays.toString(a));
    }
}
```

---

小提醒：冒泡排序时间复杂度平均/最坏是 **O(n²)**，适合小数据或教学用～  
